<i>♪ Love is blindness ♪</i>

30
00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.079
<i>♪ I don't want to see ♪</i>

31
00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:21.455
<i>♪ Won't you wrap the night ♪</i>

32
